<%# Demo homepage. Every figure and quote is governed by the MCP claims ledger
    (portfolio/mcp-server/claims-ledger.md in the site repository, private):
    99,441 orders C1 K2 · 9 read-only tools C3 C6 · OAuth with PKCE C5 · 334 I2 E2 · R,172,191.68 I5 E3 K7
    · 5/35 and 35/35 V1 · 9/9 V2 · 6/6 V3 · 2/2 V4 · 12/12 = 3 historical + 9 pre-fix V5 · 45/45 V10 K5
    · fingerprint V8 E1 · defect classes D1-D9 · caveats K1 K2 K5 · oracle independence M1.
    The two transcripts are the questions, tool calls (production log) and opening sentences of the answers
    recorded on 29 September 2026 in the approved demo video. %>
